{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13195","headline":"寄高云 · 皇甫冉","name":"寄高云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南徐风日好，怅望毘陵道。\n毘陵有故人，一见恨无因。\n独恋青山久，唯令白发新。\n每嫌持手板，时见着头巾。\n烟景临寒食，农桑接仲春。\n家贫仍嗜酒，生事今何有。\n芳草遍江南，劳心忆携手。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13195.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13195","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}